,805\n\nSo the total for regular weekly and annual maturing as of Jan 31, 1970 = 71,805 million dollars\n\nFor tax anticipation Treasury bills in 1970:\n- Mar. 1970: 1,752\n- Apr. 1970: 3,014\n- June 1970: 4,508\n\nTotal tax anticipation: 1,752 + 3,014 + 4,508 = 9,274 million dollars\n\nNow for January 31, 1975 (from treasury_bulletin_1975_03_page_71.txt):\n\nLooking at the 1975 data, the table shows the issues as of January 31, 1975. I see regular weekly and annual maturing Treasury bills from Feb 1975 through Jan 1976, and tax anticipation bills in Apr 1975 and June 1975.\n\nFor the regular weekly and annual maturing category, the bills are: Feb 1975 (20,916), Mar 1975 (20,031), Apr 1975 (20,328), May 1975 (14,812), June 1975 (13,517), July 1975 (14,819), Aug 1975 (1,803), Sept 1975 (1,803), Oct 1975 (2,003), Nov 1975 (2,002), Dec 1975 (2,001), and Jan 1976 (2,001). This adds up to 115,536 million dollars.\n\nThe tax anticipation bills total 3,507 million dollars (2,251 + 1,256).\n\nThe absolute change in regular weekly and annual maturing Treasury bills from 1970 to 1975 is 115,536 - 71,805 = 43,731 million dollars, while tax anticipation bills changed by 3,507 - 9,274 = -5,767 million dollars.\n\nWait, I need to reconsider the question. The 1975 data shows Feb 1975 through Jan 1976, but since we're looking at January 31, 1975, I should only include bills that mature in 1975 and earlier. The Jan 1976 issue wouldn't be included yet as of that date, so I need to recalculate using only Feb 1975 through Dec 1975 instead.\n\nThe regular weekly and annual maturing total becomes 113,535 (excluding Jan 1976), and tax anticipation bills remain at 3,507. This gives absolute changes of 41,730 for regular bills and -5,767 for tax anticipation, with a Euclidean norm of approximately 42,137.23 million dollars, which rounds to 42,137.23.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_0e844f33566eff9c","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOF'\nimport math\n\n# 1970 data (from treasury_bulletin_1970_03_page_88.txt)\n# Regular weekly and annual maturing Treasury bills\nregular_1970 = 1501 + 13510 + 13516 + 16525 + 6308 + 6512 + 7721 + 1701 + 1505 + 1003 + 1001 + 1002\n\n# Tax anticipation Treasury bills\ntax_1970 = 1752 + 3014 + 4508\n\n# 1975 data (from treasury_bulletin_1975_03_page_71.txt)\n# Regular weekly and annual maturing Treasury bills - Feb 1975 through Dec 1975\n# (excluding Jan 1976 which is beyond Jan 31, 1975)\nregular_1975 = 20916 + 20031 + 20328 + 14812 + 13517 + 14819 + 1803 + 1803 + 2003 + 2002 + 2001\n\n# Tax anticipation Treasury bills\ntax_1975 = 2251 + 1256\n\n# Absolute changes\nregular_change = abs(regular_1975 - regular_1970)\ntax_change = abs(tax_1975 - tax_1970)\n\n# Euclidean norm\neuclidean_norm = math.sqrt(regular_change**2 + tax_change**2)\n\nprint(f\"1970 Regular weekly and annual maturing: {regular_1970}\")\nprint(f\"1970 Tax anticipation: {tax_1970}\")\nprint(f\"1975 Regular weekly and annual maturing: {regular_1975}\")\nprint(f\"1975 Tax anticipation: {tax_1975}\")\nprint(f\"Absolute change regular: {regular_change}\")\nprint(f\"Absolute change tax: {tax_change}\")\nprint(f\"Euclidean norm: {euclidean_norm}\")\nprint(f\"Euclidean norm rounded to nearest hundredth: {round(euclidean_norm, 2)}\")\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
